139
00:04:35,780 --> 00:04:36,882
to real customers.

140
00:04:37,062 --> 00:04:37,922
It's illegal.

141
00:04:38,102 --> 00:04:39,843
Multi level marketing,

142
00:04:39,843 --> 00:04:42,377
or MLM, is legal when it's built

143
00:04:42,377 --> 00:04:44,673
around genuine product sales.

144
00:04:44,853 --> 00:04:47,114
But many MLMs reward recruiting heavily,

145
00:04:47,114 --> 00:04:49,658
and the structure means most participants are

146
00:04:49,658 --> 00:04:50,449
at the bottom.

147
00:04:50,799 --> 00:04:53,050
A survey by the AARP Foundation in

148
00:04:53,050 --> 00:04:55,766
twenty eighteen found that nearly half of

149
00:04:55,766 --> 00:04:58,282
MLM participants said they lost money,

150
00:04:58,282 --> 00:05:00,998
and about another quarter said they broke

151
00:05:00,998 --> 00:05:01,329
even.

152
00:05:01,509 --> 00:05:04,644
The Federal Trade Commission has warned that

153
00:05:04,644 --> 00:05:05,571
in many MLMs,

154
00:05:05,571 --> 00:05:08,777
the vast majority of participants make little

155
00:05:08,777 --> 00:05:09,633
or no money,

156
00:05:09,633 --> 00:05:12,768
after counting what they spend on inventory,

157
00:05:12,768 --> 00:05:13,908
fees and events.

158
00:05:14,259 --> 00:05:15,698
The math is the problem.

159
00:05:15,878 --> 00:05:18,241
If each person needs to recruit five

160
00:05:18,241 --> 00:05:20,539
people, who each recruit five more,

161
00:05:20,539 --> 00:05:22,246
you run out of people in a

162
00:05:22,246 --> 00:05:24,609
surprisingly small number of levels.

163
00:05:24,789 --> 00:05:26,209
By level ten or so,

164
00:05:26,209 --> 00:05:28,899
you'd need millions of new recruits.

165
00:05:29,079 --> 00:05:30,936
The people near the top can earn

166
00:05:30,936 --> 00:05:31,285
a lot.

167
00:05:31,465 --> 00:05:33,926
Everyone else is chasing a shrinking pool.

168
00:05:34,276 --> 00:05:37,829
Try this: before joining any business opportunity,

169
00:05:37,829 --> 00:05:41,382
ask for the company's income disclosure statement,

170
00:05:41,382 --> 00:05:43,088
which many MLMs publish.

171
00:05:43,268 --> 00:05:45,816
Look at what the typical participant earns,

172
00:05:45,816 --> 00:05:47,238
not the top one percent.

173
00:05:47,418 --> 00:05:49,067
Then subtract your costs.

174
00:05:49,247 --> 00:05:51,058
That's your realistic outcome.

175
00:05:51,408 --> 00:05:54,035
If every person recruits five new people,

176
00:05:54,035 --> 00:05:56,214
the number needed doubles quickly.

177
00:05:56,394 --> 00:05:57,690
By the tenth level,

178
00:05:57,690 --> 00:06:00,351
a pyramid would need nearly ten million

179
00:06:00,351 --> 00:06:00,829
people.

180
00:06:01,179 --> 00:06:02,444
Scheme number three.

181
