239
00:07:52,595 --> 00:07:54,632
Only a tiny fraction earned more than

240
00:07:54,632 --> 00:07:56,008
the minimum wage from it.

241
00:07:56,358 --> 00:07:57,774
Why do most lose?

242
00:07:57,954 --> 00:08:01,622
You're competing against professional firms with faster

243
00:08:01,622 --> 00:08:04,223
computers, better data and lower costs.

244
00:08:04,403 --> 00:08:06,443
Every trade can have costs,

245
00:08:06,443 --> 00:08:09,163
like spreads and taxes on short term

246
00:08:09,163 --> 00:08:09,616
gains.

247
00:08:09,796 --> 00:08:11,955
And emotions, fear and greed,

248
00:08:11,955 --> 00:08:14,487
make people sell low and buy high.

249
00:08:14,667 --> 00:08:16,825
Day trading is a contest where most

250
00:08:16,825 --> 00:08:18,243
players are outmatched.

251
00:08:18,593 --> 00:08:20,493
Try this: if you want to learn

252
00:08:20,493 --> 00:08:23,026
